0227: SwapEnd presents the swap itself (after the GPU finished the surface) instead of at the next vsync tick, so the buffer it replaces is off the panel when it returns: with the GPU drawing straight into the window server's surfaces the next frame was drawn into the buffer still shown. Boot-arg sweetflipnow=0: at the tick as before.

